     "body": "<p>This has been implemented for the REST API modifyDatastream and modifyObject methods in trunk (r8588). As noted on the committers' call (25 May) since we're able to implement this as an optional feature in the REST API without having to refactor the underlying SOAP API, we're going to limit the scope of this feature to the REST API (at least for 3.4).</p>",
